{
 "about": "Where a set's INACTIVE status counts. A nested INACTIVE set still applied to a check in round 24, to allow and to deny, while a top-level INACTIVE set did not. Besides the two controls, each case has a check and a filter request: a nested INACTIVE set that allows, that brings an rsqlPredicate, and that denies under DENY_OVERRIDES beside a policy that allows or under PERMIT_UNLESS_DENY alone; an INACTIVE set two levels down; an INACTIVE set in the middle of a chain of three; and a top-level INACTIVE set around an ACTIVE nested set that allows.",
